<div dir=3D"auto">Hi, Allison.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Thank you for getting back to me. I want to be accommodat=
ing to you so either time works for me. If you have the information you nee=
d by 9am, that would be best as they've essentially asked me to leave by 1p=
m without providing me any paperwork.
 I am currently trying to navigate this situation to the best of my ability=
. And yes, that's the best number to reach me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Kind Regards,&nbsp;</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Sam</div>
