<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Hi Robert Samuel,=
</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">I would like to s=
chedule a time to talk with you regarding this dismissal and hear from you =
about your experience and the expectations as they were shared with you. I =
do also need to gather information from
 the park as well, so a phone call tomorrow would be best.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Are you available=
 for tomorrow at 9:00 am or 1:00 pm? And is this the best number to reach y=
ou at: 458-230-1869?</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">If neither of tho=
se times work, please let me know a time that will and I will do my best to=
 make it happen.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
