<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">Hi, Allison.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">I'm writing to inform y=
ou that I was unexpectedly dismissed from my volunteer position at Honeyman=
 State Park today, one week before my scheduled departure. I was not given =
any paperwork or official documentation.
 I was simply told to turn over my keys and leave within 24 hours.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">I believe this dismissa=
l was not only unprofessional but retaliatory, stemming from a series of es=
calating tensions initiated after I submitted a respectful email expressing=
 concern over a prior interaction with
 leadership. Since that moment, I=92ve experienced a breakdown in communica=
tion, exclusion, and intimidation. Today=92s action felt targeted and final=
, without process or fairness.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">Because I had already c=
ommitted to this volunteer program for the full year=97with parks lined up =
nearly every month=97this sudden dismissal has placed me in a logistical an=
d financial crisis. I have no current housing
 and limited funds until I begin my next assignment.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">To help provide a fulle=
r picture, I=92ve recorded a video explaining the sequence of events and th=
e emotional and practical weight this situation has placed on me. I=92ve al=
so included my documentation.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">You can view the video =
here:</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in"><a href=3D"https://yout=
u.be/B1oe-qvjmMI">https://youtu.be/B1oe-qvjmMI</a></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">I am reaching out not o=
nly to request review of how this was handled but to ask whether there is a=
ny immediate support the department can offer as I transition. I believe I=
=92ve served with integrity and deep commitment
 to the mission of Oregon State Parks, and I only ask that I be treated wit=
h the same respect.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">Thank you for your time=
 and attention. I am available to speak further if necessary.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">Warm regards,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">Robert Samuel White (Ho=
st 40423)</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:.5in">458-230-1869</p>
